<human_speech><green>Same adversary as last time. It has learned nothing since, and neither has it forgotten anything.<\green><blue>It judges a sub by its garrison, <\blue><golden><shining>Blotto<\golden><\shining><blue>. Idle plus inbound. Nothing else.<\blue><green>So give it a garrison that lies. A few ships next to a fortress read as weak. The fortress does not.<\green><blue>And once it has spent its strike, look at its subs.<\blue><\human_speech>
